[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n5_godric"
text = "# DRAFT
# Abbot Godric at dusk, on his knees in the chapter house where it happened (night 5, clear and cold). Frail, sick from
# the incense, praying. He names the dead: Edwin, Wulfric, and Simon if he died. He won't burn less incense, and won't
# send for the bishop. (He collapses from the smoke at Matins tonight. Nothing here says so.)
== start
(The abbot kneels by the dark stain on the chapter house floor, lips moving. He coughs till he has to hold the bench.)
Godric: My son. No, leave me. I'll pray here, where it happened.
-> topics

== again
(The abbot hasn't moved. His breath rattles.)
Godric: Still here, child? Pray with me, then, or let me pray.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n5_godric_dead] Who are you praying for, Father Abbot? -> dead
* [if not n5_godric_incense] Could you burn less incense, Father Abbot? It's making you ill. -> incense
* [if not n5_godric_bishop] Will you send for the bishop, Father Abbot? -> bishop

== dead [set n5_godric_dead]
Godric: I've said their names at every office today. Edwin, who read so badly at table. Wulfric, here before me.
-> dead_simon [if died_simon]
-> topics

== dead_simon
Godric: And Simon, here. On these stones. In my own chapter house.
-> topics

== incense [set n5_godric_incense]
Godric: Less? It's all that stands between this house and it.
(He coughs into his sleeve, and looks at what he's coughed.)
Godric: Ranulf says more. I'll give it more.
-> topics

== bishop [set n5_godric_bishop]
Godric: And tell him a demon walks in my house? He'd shut our doors and send our saint to Canterbury.
Godric: No. We'll bear it ourselves, as Our Lord bore it. God hasn't forgotten us.
-> topics

== leave
Godric: Count us at Matins, my son. All that are left.
"
